# PeerUp Collective — Complete Website Theme Transformation

## Project Objective

Transform the entire existing PeerUp Collective website into a cohesive, premium, futuristic technology brand using the approved new visual direction and moodboard.

**Repository:** `pradyu25/peerup`  
**Website:** `https://peerup.in`  
**Brand:** PeerUp Collective  
**Year established:** 2024  
**Brand positioning:** Founder-led product company with a product-lab and venture-building approach.

This is a complete visual-system and UI-consistency update across the existing website, not a homepage-only redesign.

Preserve the existing React application, working functionality, content architecture, interactive components, and distinctive creative identity wherever possible. Do not rebuild the website from scratch or replace functional features with static mockups.

The finished website should feel like a premium, modern technology company: minimal, expressive, futuristic, polished, and recognizable through its electric cyan–blue–violet–magenta gradients.

