- Translucent white or dark surfaces with subtle gradient highlights.
- Used sparingly for floating panels, navigation controls, and selected overlays.

Use CSS custom properties for the color tokens and gradient presets. Ensure the gradient transitions remain smooth and do not create harsh color bands.

